## Why This Is Asked

Runtime extensibility with safe isolation is common in admin consoles; a clean plugin boundary reduces churn and hot-swapping risk.

## Key Concepts

- Runtime plugin loading via dynamic import
- Command registry with register/unregister/get
- Isolation and non-blocking execution via async tasks
